  << /ActualText (Design and product leader who has shipped consumer digital products and connected hardware at Amazon\054 Meta\054 and Yahoo\041\054 and as a startup founder\056 Managed and mentored product design teams at Meta and 8tracks while staying hands\055on\056 Working fluency in front\055end engineering \050React\054 SwiftUI\051\054 including production code shipped across web\054 macOS\054 and plugin surfaces\054 which makes feasibility a design conversation rather than a handoff to engineering\056\n\nCurrently founder and CEO of Collaya\054 an AI music\055tech platform taken from concept to market and now self\055sustaining\056 Open to design leadership roles \050Product Design Manager\054 Director or Head of Design\051\054 Principal Product Designer\054 and Head of Product at early\055stage companies\056)
