2227 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Founder and CEO of Collaya\054 an artist\055first music\055tech platform and audio plugin built on frontier AI models\054 defined from a blank page in a niche\054 creative category\056 It works with a musician\047s own audio and MIDI to spark ideas and act as a virtual co\055producer\054 a deliberately consent\055based approach to music AI\056\nOwn the roadmap\054 prioritization\054 and requirements as head of product\054 running discovery with working musicians and defining the KPIs that steer the product\056\nDesign and build the full product experience\072 MIDI and audio idea generation\054 collaboration flows\054 and co\055producer interactions\056\nBuilt the design system that keeps the AU\057VST plugin\054 macOS app\054 and web platform consistent\054 and ship production features across all three using AI\055assisted development\056\nDrive brand and go\055to\055market execution\072 marketing creative\054 video and audio content\054 the website\054 and social presence\056\nHired and directed a cross\055functional team of 6 spanning AI engineering\054 QA\054 and creative advisory\054 setting craft standards and priorities\056)
     /K [ 14 ]
     /P 2228 0 R
     /Pg 2199 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
