  << /ActualText (Designed and led integrity and trust experiences within Meta\047s Cross\055Integrity \050XI\051 Business Authenticity organization\054 focused on Commerce Integrity and Business Messaging Integrity\056\nDesigned across Meta\047s Business Integrity surface area\054 the systems that let billions of people trust businesses on Facebook\054 including verification types such as registered brand information\054 domain\054 and bank verification\056\nOwned design for core Facebook Pages surfaces\054 from Page creation and first\055time setup through admin tools and growth hooks\054 including the primary Pages navigation entry points across the Facebook app\056\nPromoted from individual contributor to product design manager\054 leading and mentoring a team of 3 designers across Business Integrity\054 while continuing to design hands\055on\056)
