2263 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Drove zero\055to\055one design for Amazon Key\054 a connected\055hardware delivery platform spanning smart lock\054 camera\054 and vehicle\054 taking it from concept to a 37\055city launch against one of Amazon\047s costliest delivery problems\056\nLead and primary designer from early development\054 owning first\055time user experience and core in\055app flows across two launches\072 in\055home delivery \050November 2017\051 and in\055car delivery \050April 2018\051\056 Co\055developed the design system behind both\056\nPersonally owned the majority of in\055car design across a two\055plus\055year project\054 from setup and onboarding through live delivery\056 With no connected\055car APIs available from OEMs\054 designed the setup flow around embedded OEM sign\055in webviews plus eligibility logic that scaled across a growing list of GM and Volvo models\056\nOwned trust and safety UX for an inherently high\055skepticism interaction\054 a driver entering your home or vehicle\054 including real\055time notifications\054 live Cloud Cam viewing\054 and the per\055screen copy that set a clear\054 trustworthy tone\056\nAlpha and usability testing showed customers did not grasp the service even after reading program materials\056 Redesigned onboarding cards and per\055screen copy\054 measurably improving comprehension\056)
     /K [ 32 ]
     /P 2264 0 R
     /Pg 2199 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
